commentForGermanFunding=Text has been added to your acknowledgments because we have identified that the corresponding author of this paper is affiliated to a Max Planck institute. We have an open access agreement with the Max Planck Society (Max-Planck-Gesellschaft), and under this agreement they will automatically cover the article processing charge (APC) for eligible authors. Please do not request to remove this text or change the affiliation details of the eligible corresponding author unless you confirm to us that you wish to opt out of this agreement.
commentForMissingCitationRSC_Single= A citation to %s has been added here, please check that the placement of this citation is suitable. If the location is not suitable, please indicate where in the text the citation should be inserted.
commentForMissingCitationRSC_Multiple= Citations to %s have been added, please check that the placement of these citations is suitable. If the locations are not suitable, please indicate where in the text the citations should be inserted.
commentForMissingCitation=Please note that '%s' was/were not cited in the text. Please check that the citation(s) suggested by the copyeditor are in the appropriate place, and correct if necessary.
queryForMissingCitation=AUTHOR: %s was not cited in the text. An attempt has been made to insert the %s into a relevant point in the text - please check that this is OK. If not, please provide clear guidance on where it should be cited in the text.
commentForSingularAbbreviation=Use singular abbreviation if appropriate.
commentForPluralAbbreviation=Use plural abbreviation if appropriate.
commentForApostropheAbbreviation=Do not use apostrophe in abbreviations.
commentForCloseMatch=Please delete the citation in the unlisted section if you are changing the citation.
commentForAuthorInitialsinAck=Change the initials to author name if appropriate (eg, J. Smith).
commentForMultipleAuthorInitialsinAck=Expand author names (eg, J. Smith). This initial matches with more than one author (ie, %s). Hence check and query if needed.
commentForFullCapsAuthorNamesinAu=Author names are given in full caps in author group. Check and expand author surnames in acknowledgment (eg, J. Smith).
commentForUnlistedRef=The citations '%s' has been changed to match the author name/date in the reference list. Please check here and in subsequent occurrences.
fnCOIsuggestion=Check the use of conflict of interest statement here.
