queryForKeywordInArticleTitle_1=Please note that as per journal style, keywords should be different from the one used in the article title. But the keywords section contains the words \u201C%s\u201D which are used in the article title. Kindly check and provide the keywords as per the journal style.
queryForKeywordInArticleTitle_2=Please note that as per journal style, keywords should be different from the one used in the article title. But the keywords section contains the word \u201C%s\u201D which is used in the article title. Kindly check and provide the keywords as per the journal style.
