highlightEnuncEndgroupCountMismatch=Please check endgrouping for all enunciations.
CommentMessageForCharCount=Please note that as per style, the running head should contain only 50 characters; the given running head exceeds 50 characters. Please check.
CommentMessageForAtlCharCount=Please note that as per style, the running head should contain only 50 characters; the introduced running head exceeds 50 characters. Please check.
roleForList=Role 'bullet' or 'simple' introduced at the end of list.
roleForReference=Role tag introduced at the end of bibitem for book, journal, online and other references.
roleForAbstracttitle=Role 'executive-summary' introduced at the end of abstracttitle with 'significant' statements.
