highlightMissingCorrAuFromOrder=Corresponding author is not mentioned in meta-data. Check and raise author query if ORCID is missing for the corresponding author.
queryForMissingOrcidIdForCorrAu=It is very important for the corresponding author to have a linked ORCID (Open Researcher and Contributor ID) account on MTS. To register a linked ORCID account, please go to the Account Update page (http://mts.hindawi.com/update/) in our Manuscript Tracking System and after you have logged in click on the ORCID link at the top of the page. This link will take you to the ORCID website where you will be able to create an account for yourself. Once you have done so, your new ORCID will be saved in our Manuscript Tracking System automatically.
editedGSQuery=Have we correctly interpreted the following funding source(s) and country names you cited in your article: %s?
missedGSQuery=Have we correctly interpreted the following funding source(s) you cited in your article: %s?
gsMultiQueryMsg=Insert respective author query: first query if grant sponsor is present (use the edited sponsor name and its respective country) and latter if no sponsor is available.
QueryForZerokwd=Please provide two to five keywords or indicate that no keywords should be listed.
QueryForOnekwd=PNAS allows up to five keywords. Because we prefer to avoid publishing a single keyword, please add at least one more keyword (and specify your preferred order in which the keywords should appear) or delete the keywords entirely.
QueryForTwoToFourkwd=PNAS allows up to five keywords. You may add %s %s. Also, please check the order of your keywords and approve or reorder them as necessary.
QueryForFivekwd=Please check the order of your keywords and approve or reorder them as necessary. Note that PNAS allows up to five keywords; please do not add new keywords unless you wish to replace others.
QueryForMoreThanFivekwd=PNAS allows up to five keywords. Please delete as many keywords as necessary to meet the five-term limit.
gsRangeNotMatchedMsg=Sponsor name does not match closely with the database. If present in database, append with the fundref ID and raise resp. author query.
highlightIfChapterNumNotAppended=Use the format 'chapter number, followed by a period, followed by the float number in Arabic'.
highlightMultiWordInSingleConStyle=Use the allowed standard term with the respective charstyle.
queryForMismatchedConRole_singleAu=We find that the role(s) provided for the author \u201C%s\u201D does not match the list of acceptable roles. Please choose a role from the below list for this author: Conceptualization, Methodology, Software, Validation, Formal Analysis, Investigation, Resources, Data Curation, Writing \u2013 Original Draft, Writing \u2013 Review & Editing, Visualization, Supervision, Project Administration, Funding Acquisition.
queryForMismatchedConRole_multiAu=We find that the role(s) provided for the authors \u201C%s\u201D do not match the list of acceptable roles. Please choose a role from the below list for these authors: Conceptualization, Methodology, Software, Validation, Formal Analysis, Investigation, Resources, Data Curation, Writing \u2013 Original Draft, Writing \u2013 Review & Editing, Visualization, Supervision, Project Administration, Funding Acquisition.
suggestionForMismatchedConRole=Charstyle and text do not match. Check and change accordingly.
mutliEmailMatchForAnAu=Change the screentip with respect to the author order.
emailNotMatchWithAu=Email not directly matches with any of the author. Check and change the screentip accordingly.
