commentForPuncChange=Punctuations (,;) are corrected in indirect reference citation with optional text in between [e.g: (See John et al., 2009, Jack 2015)-\u003E(See John et al., 2009; Jack 2015)]
alertForCommaUsage=Punctuations (,;) are corrected in indirect reference citation with optional text in between [e.g: (See John et al., 2009; Jack 2015)-\u003E(See John et al., 2009, Jack 2015)]
queryForMissingCharstyle=As per journal style, reference elements should be consistent. Please provide %s for the reference%s %s.
