dociStdText=^([\u2610\u2612] ?The authors declare the following financial interests/personal relationships which may be considered as potential competing interests[:.]? ?)(.*)$
sameCoiDoci=Declaration of competing interest form submitted and the same content was provided in manuscript. We have retained the conflict of interest statement only under Declaration Competing Interest section. Please check and correct if necessary.
diffCoiDoci=Declaration of competing interest form submitted and there is a statement in the main text related to COI. Please provide the conflict-of-interest statement that you prefer.
checkedDociMoveCoiToDoci=Second option was ticked in the declaration of competing interest document but content was not provided; hence we've used the COI content provided in the Manuscript. Please confirm if this is correct.
checkedDociMissingCoiDeleteFirstDoci=During submission you have mentioned that there is a conflict of interest. However the details of same is missing. Please provide the same.
