missingbibElementsWithoutAuName=Mandatory element(s) is/are missing in ref(s) %s. Reference citation in abstract should be expanded with journal title, vol, page, year, as per stylesheet.
missingbibElementsOnlyAuName=Mandatory element(s) is/are missing in ref(s) %s. Reference citation in abstract should be expanded with author name, year, as per stylesheet.
