queryForAuthorMisMatch=Please note that the order of the author names in the manuscript differs from the order provided in the article metadata. The order provided in the manuscript has been retained; please confirm.
backMatterParaNotSeqSuggestion_2=Order of back matter should be: (1) Author Note, (2) Acknowledgements, (3) Author Contribution, (4) Declaration of Conflicting Interests, (5) Funding, (6) ORCID ID, (7) Data accessibility statement, (8) Supplemental material, (9) Notes, (10) References.
