toRenumberingFloatsInAppendix=Numbering of figures/tables/equations in Appendices should follow on from the numbering in the text.
affMissInSpecificAuthor=Because %s1 did not have an affiliation, affiliation %s2 was added for this author. If this is incorrect, please indicate the correct affiliation number or provide complete affiliation information for this author.
affMissInSpecificAuthor_Query=AUTHOR: Please provide appropriate affiliation designator for the author “%s1.”
affMissInAllAuthor=Affiliation %s was not ascribed to an author in the author list, so it was included with the first author. If this is incorrect, please update the author line as needed and/or remove the affiliation.
affMissInAllAuthor_Query=AUTHOR: Please note that affiliation “%s” is not linked to any of the authors in the author byline. Please link the affiliation to the appropriate author.
affMissInAffiliation=Affiliation %s1 is present in the author line, but affiliation text was not provided. Could you please either provide the missing affiliation text or delete affiliation %s1 from the author line?
duplicateAffInAffliation=Affiliation %s is used for two different affiliations. Could you please indicate whether both affiliations should be retained or whether one may be deleted? If both are retained, we will renumber the affiliations accordingly.
highlightduplicateAffInAffliation=Affiliation number “%s” has been used as label for more than one affiliations. Please check.
fnMissInAllAuthor=Footnote %s was not ascribed to an author in the author list, so it was included with the first author. If this is incorrect, please update the author line as needed and/or remove the footnote.
fnMissInFootnote=Footnote %s1 is present in the author line, but footnote text was not provided. Could you please either provide the missing footnote text or delete footnote %s1 from the author line?
duplicateFnInFootnote=Footnote %s is used for two different footnotes. Could you please indicate whether both footnotes should be retained or whether one may be deleted?
keywordsCountHighlight=As per style, maximum of %s keywords are allowed. %s keywords found. Please check and take necessary action.
alertForJunkCharInAwardGroup=Entity/junk character is present in the awardgroup. Please check and make necessary amendments.
