auQueryForAbsenceofOrcid=Please note that the ORCID identifier(s) is/are not available for the author(s) \u0022%s\u0022. Please check and provide the ORCID IDs.
corauQueryForAbsenceofOrcid=Please note that as per style, the ORCID information is recommended for the corresponding author. Hence, please provide ORCID for the corresponding author \u0022%s\u0022. Refer to the site \u0022https://orcid.org/\u0022 for more information about ORCID.
