alertForEssentialsIsPresent=Please check whether the section heading \u201CEssentials\u201D should be changed to \u201CHighlights\u201D as per the style sheet. If yes, also check the placement of Highlights section and also include a note for publisher query.
alertForListaMissing=As per style, highlights should be list. Please check and include the query.
alertForHighlightsOrderIsWrong=Please note that Highlights is not in the order explained in style sheet. Please move it next to Keywords and above Introduction section. Please also include a publisher query if you are changing the placement.
queryForInitial=<comment message="Please note that as per style, the author's forename should always be expanded. Kindly check and provide the expanded forenames for the author(s) \u0022%s\u0022."></comment>
backMatterParaNotSeqSuggestion_3=Order of back matter should be: (1) Acknowledgements, (2) Research funding, (3) Author Contribution, (4) Competing interest, (5) Informed consent, (6) Ethical approval and (7) References.
backMatterParaNotSeqSuggestion_4=Order of back matter should be: (1) Acknowledgements, (2) Author Contribution, (3) Research funding, (4) Conflict of interest statement and (5) References.
alertForGeneration=Please check whether this needs to be changed to roman numerals.
queryForTablePresentInAbstract=<comment message="Note that there should be no %s citations in the abstract in accordance with Frontiers\u2019 style guidelines. Kindly transfer the citations to the main text."></comment>
alertForEditedAndReviewedBy=Please check and include publisher query, if necessary.
alertForDiffEdAndRev=Details present in both the footnotes are different and hence we have not changed the text to \93Approved by\94. Please check.
