alertForCitationPresentInTheSectionHeading= citations should not appear in section headings. Relocate the citation to the text if its correct place is apparent; if not, query the author.
alertForSameInitialInAck=Truncated author names look identical. Please check.
alertForAuthorAbbreviateInAck=Middle initials should not be included in acknowledgment as per style. Please check whether the abbreviated initials have any middle initials and remove as per style.
PresentAddrFn=As per style, present address should be placed next to the correspondence field. Please check and change the placement accordingly.
citationsWithOnlyPartLabels=Please check whether all part labels present in the caption of Figure(s) %s is/are cited in the text.
highlightFigureCitationSublocants=Please check whether the sublocants is applicable for all part figures cited and make the necessary change per style.
queryTextForCitePresentOnlyInAbs=Note that there should be no reference citations in the abstract in accordance with Frontiers\u2019 style guidelines. Kindly transfer the citations to the main text.
queryForAuthorIDMissingInAuthor=<comment message="If the following authors would like their LOOP profile to be linked to the final published version, ensure that they &lt;link id='https://www.frontiersin.org/register?returnUrl=https://loop.frontiersin.org' tooltip='https://www.frontiersin.org/register?returnUrl=https://loop.frontiersin.org &gt;register'&lt;/link&gt; with Frontiers at the provided link, and provide us with the URLs to their profile(s). If just an email address is provided, the profile link will not be added to the article. Non-registered authors and authors with profiles set to "Private" will have the default profile image displayed. Note that we will not be able to add profile links after publication.%s &lt;link id='https://www.frontiersin.org.cn/authors-proof-support/#QA6' tooltip='https://www.frontiersin.org.cn/authors-proof-support/#QA6' &gt;https://www.frontiersin.org.cn/authors-proof-support/#QA6&lt;/link&gt;"></comment>
queryForAuthorIDMissingInAuthorForSociety=<comment message="If the following authors would like their LOOP profile to be linked to the final published version, ensure that they &lt;link id='%s' tooltip='%s' &gt;register&lt;/link&gt; with %s at the provided link, and provide us with the URLs to their profile(s). If just an email address is provided, the profile link will not be added to the article. Non-registered authors and authors with profiles set to "Private" will have the default profile image displayed. Note that we will not be able to add profile links after publication.%s"></comment>
alertForDiffEdAndRev=Details present in both the footnotes are different and hence we have not changed the text to “Approved by”. Please check.
queryForUncitedAppendix=Please provide the citation for %s%s.
queryForUncitedAppendix_1=%s%s has not been mentioned in the article, please add a citation within the text. &lt;link id='https://www.frontiersin.org.cn/authors-proof-support/#QA74' tooltip='https://www.frontiersin.org.cn/authors-proof-support/#QA74 &gt;https://www.frontiersin.org.cn/authors-proof-support/#QA74' &lt;/link&gt;
alertIfIntroduceSectionHeading=Please check the submission and introduce or delete the section numbering, as per the requirement.
AlertForPartialAffiliationOrgMatch=Please check whether this is identical with the organisation present in affiliation. If not include the standard query as per style.
QueryForMissingAffiliationOrg=&lt;comment message="As previously reported, you have listed a commercial affiliation(s) and/or commercial funding. Before we can proceed to publication, please provide the relevant disclosure."&gt;&lt;/comment&gt;
authorApologyAlert=Please check whether this has to be moved as a separate paragraph.
AuContributionHead=Author contributions
AuContributionBody=\u25A0\u25A0\u25A0\u25A0<?query Please note that an author contributions section is required for all Chemical Science articles. Please insert the relevant text to concisely explain each author&#x0027;s contribution to the work.?>
errorMessage=SANCTIONED AFFILIATION IS PRESENT. DO NOT PROCEED FURTHER WITH THIS ARTICLE
queryForKeyPointMissing=<comment message="Please supply Key Points for the article."></comment>
alertForCharExceedInLista=As per style, only 140 characters are allowed. Please check and raise an author query, if required.
queryForBulletPoints=<comment message="As per style, Key Points should have 3 bullet points. Kindly check and amend as required."></comment>
alertForKeyPointPosition='Key Points' need to be placed before the 'Introduction' section. Please check and make the necessary change.
queryForOrderMissMatch=<comment message="We have noticed a discrepancy between the author list in the submission system and in the accepted manuscript (for authors %s). For any authorship changes, Frontiers requires that all authors complete and sign the \u2018Authorship Change\u2019 form which is available at this link. Upload the file as a \u201CRelated Article\u201D file type together with your Author\u2019s Proof Corrections."></comment>
queryForAuthorNameMisMatch=<comment message="We have noticed a discrepancy between the author list in the submission system and in the manuscript [for author%s %s (not listed in submission system/manuscript)]. For any authorship changes, Frontiers requires that all authors complete and sign the \u2018Authorship Change\u2019 form which is available at this\u00A0&lt;link id='https://www.frontiersin.org/files/pdf/Authorship_change_form.pdf' tooltip='https://www.frontiersin.org/files/pdf/Authorship_change_form.pdf' &gt;link&lt;/link&gt;. Upload the file as a \u201CRelated Article\u201D file type together with your Author\u2019s Proof Corrections.."></comment>
alertForCountMisMatch=Authors count mismatch between manuscript and metadata. Check and take necessary action.
MultiAuthorToSingleAuthorGroup=Affiliation designators are introduced for multi-author parastyle to single-author parastyle in affiliation parastyle.
commentForWordCountInRRHAbove5=Reduce running title (top right corner starting from the 2nd page) to a maximum of five words.
commentForWordCountInRRHBelow5=Confirm that the short running title (top right corner starting from the 2nd page) is correct, making sure to keep it to a maximum of five words.
queryForMandatoryCharStyleMissing=Please update the status of the publication details of %s. %s.
confirmTheEmail =<comment message="Confirm that the email address in your correspondence section is accurate. Any changes to corresponding authors requires individual confirmation from all original and added/removed corresponding authors. &lt;link id='https://www.frontiersin.org.cn/authors-proof-support/#QA13' tooltip='https://www.frontiersin.org.cn/authors-proof-support/#QA13'&gt;https://www.frontiersin.org.cn/authors-proof-support/#QA13&lt;/link&gt;"></comment>
