alertAuthorGroup=Please check the author group and make necessary changes to the correspondence field.
abbrWithDiffExp_1=The abbreviation \u0022%s\u0022 has been defined as \u0022%s\u0022 and \u0022%s\u0022 in the document. Please check, and correct if necessary.
abbrWithDiffExp_2=The abbreviation \u0022%s\u0022 has been defined as \u0022%s\u0022 as well as \u0022%s\u0022.  Please check if the representation should be made consistent in the article.
insertAffiliationInCorrAuthor=Please check the address for the corresponding author that has been added here, and correct if necessary.
authorBiography=Please provide biographies for all authors.
useHellipforAuInBib_1=Please note that as per the journal style, if there are more than %s authors/editors, the first %s author names are listed followed by \u201C%s\u201D and then the last author\u0027s name. If the author group consists of %s authors or fewer, all author names should be listed.
useHellipforAuInBib_2=Therefore, in Ref(s). \u201C%s\u201D; please list all names for up to %s authors/editors. For more than %s authors/editors, use \u201C%s\u201D followed by the last author\u0027s name after the first %s authors/editors.
