alertFundingInCoiSec=As per style, funding information should be moved to \u201CFunding\u201D section. Please check and make necessary changes. Also include standard funding query after moving this text to \u201CFunding section\u201D.
coiStdQuerySubjectCheckForFseries=Confirm if the text included in the Conflict of Interest statement is correct. Please do not suggest edits to the wording of the final sentence, as this is standard for Frontiers' journal style, per our &lt;link id='https://www.frontiersin.org/guidelines/policies-and-publication-ethics#conflicts-of-interest' tooltip='https://www.frontiersin.org/guidelines/policies-and-publication-ethics#conflicts-of-interest&gt;guidelines'&lt;/link&gt;. &lt;link id='https://www.frontiersin.org.cn/authors-proof-support/#QA54' tooltip='https://www.frontiersin.org.cn/authors-proof-support/#QA54'&gt;https://www.frontiersin.org.cn/authors-proof-support/#QA54&lt;/link&gt;
alertMultiAuWithSameInitial=Author initials look identical. Please check.
reviewerCOI=Please check and replace with the standard COI statement, if necessary.
dataAvailabilityHead=Data availability
dataAvailabilityBody=\u25A0\u25A0\u25A0\u25A0<?query Chemical Science strongly encourages authors to deposit as much data related to their article as possible in appropriate repositories. Do you have experimental or computational data associated with this article? If so, we would encourage you to please provide a data availability statement. More details can be found on the Chemical Science website (rsc.li/ChemSci_JSG).?>
