coiBodyInSectionA=The authors declare no conflicts of interest relevant to this study.
abstractRunOn=In accordance with Frontiers style, we have changed the Abstract text into a single paragraph.
abstractRunOnWiley=AUTHOR: Journal style is to use an unstructured abstract; you supplied a structured abstract. All structuring has been removed - please check.
correctCommaPlacementFromFiveToTenDigits=Please check the placement of comma used as thousand separator for the numbers with more than five digits. Comma should be used only for groups of three places. Correct if necessary.
